udes special pitons, boot tips, gloves, and a harness. You can use the climber\'s kit as an action to anchor yourself; when you do, you can\'t fall more than 25 feet from the point where you anchored yourself, and you can\'t climb more than 25 feet away from that point without undoing the anchor.',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',25,2,12.000,0,286,1,NULL,NULL),(132,'Clothes - common',3,'',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',5,4,3.000,0,287,1,NULL,NULL),(133,'Clothes - costume',3,'',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',5,2,4.000,0,288,1,NULL,NULL),(134,'Clothes - fine',3,'',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',15,2,6.000,0,289,1,NULL,NULL),(135,'Clothes - traveler\'s',3,'',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',2,2,4.000,0,290,1,NULL,NULL),(136,'Component Pouch',3,'A component pouch is a small watertight leather belt pouch that has compartments to hold all the material components and other special items you need to cast your spells, except for those components that have a specific cost.',_binary '\0',_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '',_binary '\0',25,2,2.000,0,291,1,NULL,NULL),(137,'Crowbar',3,'Using a crowbar grants advantage to Strength checks where the crowbar\'s leverage can be applied.',_binary '\0',_binary '',2,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',2,2,5.000,0,292,1,NULL,NULL),(138,'Sprig of Mistletoe - Druidic Focus',3,'',_binary '',_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',1,2,0.000,0,293,1,NULL,NULL),(139,'Totem - Druidic Focus',3,'',_binary '',_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',1,2,0.000,0,294,1,NULL,NULL),(140,'Wooden Staff - Druidic Focus',3,'',_binary '\0',_binary '',2,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',5,2,4.000,0,295,1,NULL,NULL),(141,'Yew Wand - Druidic Focus',3,'',_binary '\0',_binary '',2,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',10,2,1.000,0,296,1,NULL,NULL),(142,'Fishing Tackle',3,'This kit includes a wooden rod, silken line, corkwood bobbers, steel hooks, lead sinkers, velvet lures, and