ld falls to the ground or into your hand if you have one free.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',5001,2,0.000,0,2,1,NULL,NULL),(219,'+1 Armor',9,'You have a +1 bonus to AC while wearing this armor.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',501,2,0.000,0,3,1,NULL,NULL),(220,'+2 Armor',9,'You have a +2 bonus to AC while wearing this armor.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',5001,2,0.000,0,4,1,NULL,NULL),(221,'+3 Armor',9,'You have a +3 bonus to AC while wearing this armor.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',50001,2,0.000,0,5,1,NULL,NULL),(222,'Armor of Invulnerability',9,'You have resistance to non-magical damage while you wear this armor. Additionally, you can use an action to make yourself immune to non-magical damage for 10 minutes or until you are no longer wearing the armor. Once this special action is used, it can’t be used again until the next dawn.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',50001,2,0.000,0,6,1,NULL,NULL),(223,'Armor of Resistance - Acid',9,'You have resistance to acid damage while you wear this armor.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',501,2,0.000,0,7,1,NULL,NULL),(224,'Armor of Resistance - Cold',9,'You have resistance to cold damage while you wear this armor.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',501,2,0.000,0,8,1,NULL,NULL),(225,'Armor of Resistance - Fire',9,'You have resistance to fire damage while you wear this armor.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',501,2,0.000,0,9,1,NULL,NULL),(226,'Armor of Resistance - Force',9,'You have resistance to force damage while you wear this armor.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',501,2,0.000,0,10,1,NULL,NULL),(227,'Armor of Resistance - Lightning',9,'You have resistance to lightning damage while you wear this armor.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',501,2,0.000,0,11,1,NULL,NULL),(228,'Armor of Resistance - Necrotic',9,'You have resistance to necrotic damage while you wear this armor.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',501,2,0.000,0,12,1,NULL,NULL),(229,'Armor of Resistance - Poison',9,'You have resistance to poison damage while you wear this armor.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',501,2,0.000,0,13,1,NULL,NULL),(230,'Armor of Resistance - Psychic',9,'You have resistance to psychic damage while you wear this armor.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',501,2,0.000,0,14,1,NULL,NULL),(231,'Armor of Resistance - Radiant',9,'You have resistance to radiant damage while you wear this armor.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',501,2,0.000,0,15,1,NULL,NULL),(232,'Armor of Resistance - Thunder',9,'You have resistance to thunder damage while you wear this armor.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',501,2,0.000,0,16,1,NULL,NULL),(233,'Armor of Vulnerability',9,'While wearing this armor, you have resistance to one of the following damage types: bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing. The GM chooses the type or determines it randomly.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',501,2,0.000,0,17,1,NULL,NULL),(234,'Arrow-Catching Shield',9,'You gain a +2 bonus to AC against ranged attacks while you wield this shield. This bonus is in addition to the shield’s normal bonus to AC. In addition, whenever an attacker makes a ranged attack against a target within 5 feet of you, you can use your reaction to become the target of the attack instead.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',501,2,0.000,0,18,1,NULL,NULL),(235,'Demon Armor',9,'While wearing this armor, you gain a +1 bonus to AC, and you can understand and speak Abyssal. In addition, the armor’s clawed gauntlets turn unarmed strikes with your hands into magic weapons that deal slashing damage, with a +1 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls and a damage die of 1d8.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',501,2,0.000,0,19,1,NULL,NULL),(236,'Dragon Scale Mail - Black (Acid)',9,'Dragon scale mail is made of the scales of one kind of dragon. Sometimes dragons collect their cast-off scales and gift them to humanoids. Other times, hunters carefully skin and preserve the hide of a dead dragon. In either case, dragon scale mail is highly valued.\n\nWhile wearing this armor, you gain a +1 bonus to AC, you have advantage on saving throws against the Frightful Presence and breath weapons of dragons, and you have resistance to Acid damage.\n\nAdditionally, you can focus your senses as an action to magically discern the distance and direction to the closest Black dragon within 30 miles of you. This special action can’t be used again until the next dawn.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',5001,2,0.000,0,20,1,NULL,NULL),(237,'Dragon Scale Mail - Blue (Lightning)',9,'Dragon scale mail is made of the scales of one kind of dragon. Sometimes dragons collect their cast-off scales and gift them to humanoids. Other times, hunters carefully skin and preserve the hide of a dead dragon. In either case, dragon scale mail is highly valued.\n\nWhile wearing this armor, you gain a +1 bonus to AC, you have advantage on saving throws against the Frightful Presence and breath weapons of dragons, and you have resistance to Lightning damage.\n\nAdditionally, you can focus your senses as an action to magically discern the distance and direction to the closest Blue dragon within 30 miles of you. This special action can’t be used again until the next dawn.',_binary '\0',_binary '',3,_binary '\0',_binary '\0',5001,2,0.000,0,21,1,NULL,NULL),(238,'Dragon Scale Mail - Brass (Fire)',9,'Dragon scale mail is made of the scales of one kind of dragon. Sometimes dragons collect their cast-off scales and gift them to humanoids. Other times, hunters carefully skin and preserve the hide of a dead dragon. In either case, dragon scale mail is highly valued.\n\nWhile wearing this armor, you gain a +1 bonus to AC, you have advan