ld damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.'),(528,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,2,_binary '\0',13,NULL,3,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The dragon exhales paralyzing gas in a 15-foot cone. Each creature in that area must succeed on a DC 13 Constitution saving throw or be paralyzed for 1 minute. A creature can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.'),(530,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The dragon turtle makes three attacks: one with its bite and two with its claws. It can make one tail attack in place of its two claw attacks.'),(531,1,0,1,15,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',13,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','Reach 15 ft., one target'),(532,1,0,1,10,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',13,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','Reach 10 ft., one target'),(533,1,0,1,15,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',13,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','Reach 15 ft., one target: If the target is a creature, it must succeed on a DC 20 Strength saving throw or be pushed up to 10 feet away from the dragon turtle and knocked prone.'),(534,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,2,_binary '\0',18,NULL,3,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '','The dragon turtle exhales scalding steam in a 60-foot cone. Each creature in that area must make a DC 18 Constitution saving throw, taking 52 (15d6) fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. Being underwater doesn\'t grant resistance against this damage.'),(539,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The drider makes three attacks, either with its longsword or its longbow. It can replace one of those attacks with a bite attack'),(540,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(541,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(542,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(543,1,0,2,0,150,600,62,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(547,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',2,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(548,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(549,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,2,_binary '\0',14,NULL,5,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The dryad targets one humanoid or beast that she can see within 30 feet of her. If the target can see the dryad, it must succeed on a DC 14 Wisdom saving throw or be magically charmed. The charmed creature regards the dryad as a trusted friend to be heeded and protected. Although the target isn\'t under the dryad\'s control, it takes the dryad\'s requests or actions in the most favorable way it can.\n\nEach time the dryad or its allies do anything harmful to the target, it can repeat the saving throw, ending the effect on itself on a success. Otherwise, the effect lasts 24 hours or until the dryad dies, is on a different plane of existence from the target, or ends the effect as a bonus action. If a target\'s saving throw is successful, the target is immune to the dryad\'s Fey Charm for the next 24 hours.\n\nThe dryad can have no more than one humanoid and up to three beasts charmed at a time.'),(552,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','For 1 minute, the duergar magically increases in size, along with anything it is wearing or carrying. While enlarged, the duergar is Large, doubles its damage dice on Strength-based weapon attacks (included in the attacks), and makes Strength checks and Strength saving throws with advantage. If the duergar lacks the room to become Large, it attains the maximum size possible in the space available.'),(553,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(554,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(555,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(556,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(557,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The duergar magically turns invisible until it attacks, casts a spell, or uses its Enlarge, or until its concentration is broken, up to 1 hour (as if concentrating on a spell). Any equipment the duergar wears or carries is invisible with it.'),(559,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The elemental makes two slam attacks.'),(560,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',8,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(561,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,2,_binary '\0',13,NULL,1,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '','Each creature in the elemental\'s space must make a DC 13 Strength saving throw. On a failure, a target takes 15 (3d8 + 2) bludgeoning damage and is flung up 20 feet away from the elemental in a random direction and knocked prone. If a thrown target strikes an object, such as a wall or floor, the target takes 3 (1d6) bludgeoning damage for every 10 feet it was thrown. If the target is thrown at another creature, that creature must succeed on a DC 13 Dexterity saving throw or take the same damage and be knocked prone.\n\nIf the saving throw is successful, the target takes half the bludgeoning damage and isn\'t flung away or knocked prone.'),(564,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The elemental makes two slam attacks.'),(565,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',8,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','reach 10 ft., one target'),(569,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The elemental makes two touch attacks.'),(570,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','If the target is a creature or a flammable object, it ignites. Until a creature takes an action to douse the fire, the target takes 5 (1d10) fire damage at the start of each of its turns.'),(573,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The elemental makes two slam attacks.'),(574,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(575,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,2,_binary '\0',15,NULL,1,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','Each creature in the elemental\'s space must make a DC 15 Strength saving throw. On a failure, a target takes 13 (2d8 + 4) bludgeoning damage. If it is Large or smaller, it is also grappled (escape DC 14). Until this grapple ends, the target is restrained and unable to breathe unless it can breathe water. If the saving throw is successful, the target is pushed out of the elemental\'s space.\n\nThe elemental can grapple one Large creature or up to two Medium or smaller creatures at one time. At the start of each of the elemental\'s turns, each target grappled by it takes 13 (2d8 + 4) bludgeoning damage. A creature within 5 feet of the elemental can pull a creature or object out of it by taking an action to make a DC 14 Strength and succeeding.'),(578,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(579,1,0,2,0,30,120,64,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The target must succeed on a DC 13 Constitution saving throw or be poisoned for 1 hour. If the saving throw fails by 5 or more, the target is also unconscious while poisoned in this way. The target wakes up if it takes damage or if another creature takes an action to shake it awake.'),(583,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The ettercap makes two attacks: one with its bite and one with its claws.'),(584,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The target must succeed on a DC 11 Constitution saving throw or be poisoned for 1 minute. The creature can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.'),(585,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(586,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','+4 to hit, range 30/60 ft., one Large or smaller creature. Hit: The creature is restrained by webbing. As an action, the restrained creature can make a DC 11 Strength check, escaping from the webbing on a success. The effect also ends if the webbing is destroyed. The webbing has AC 10, 5 hit points, vulnerability to fire damage, and immunity to bludgeoning, poison, and psychic damage.'),(589,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The ettin makes two attacks: one with its battleaxe and one with its morningstar.'),(590,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(591,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(593,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','When bright light or a creature is within 30 feet of the shrieker, it emits a shriek audible within 300 feet of it. The shrieker continues to shriek until the disturbance moves out of range and for 1d4 of the shrieker\'s turns afterward.'),(595,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The fungus makes 1d4 Rotting Touch attacks.'),(596,1,0,1,10,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',2,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','Reach 10 ft., one creature'),(598,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The gargoyle makes two attacks: one with its bite and one with its claws'),(599,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(600,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(602,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The djinni makes three scimitar attacks.'),(603,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',9,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','Lightning or Thunder damage (Djinni\'s Choice)'),(604,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','A 5-foot-radius, 30-foot-tall cylinder of swirling air magically forms on a point the djinni can see within 120 feet of it. The whirlwind lasts as long as the djinni maintains concentration (as if concentrating on a spell). Any creature but the djinni that enters the whirlwind must succeed on a DC 18 Strength saving throw or be restrained by it. The djinni can move the whirlwind up to 60 feet as an action, and creatures restrained by the whirlwind move with it. The whirlwind ends if the djinni loses sight of it.\n\nA creature can use its action to free a creature restrained by the whirlwind, including itself, by succeeding on a DC 18 Strength check. If the check succeeds, the creature is no longer restrained and moves to the nearest space outside the whirlwind.'),(606,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The efreeti makes two scimitar attacks or uses its Hurl Flame twice.'),(607,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',10,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(608,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','Range 120 ft., one target'),(611,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',5,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(612,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The ghost enters the Ethereal Plane from the Material Plane, or vice versa. It is visible on the Material Plane while it is in the Border Ethereal, and vice versa, yet it can\'t affect or be affected by anything on the other plane.'),(613,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','Each non-undead creature within 60 feet of the ghost that can see it must succeed on a DC 13 Wisdom saving throw or be frightened for 1 minute. If the save fails by 5 or more, the target also ages 1d4 × 10 years. A frightened target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the frightened condition on itself on a success. If a target\'s saving throw is successful or the effect ends for it, the target is immune to this ghost\'s Horrifying Visage for the next 24 hours. The aging effect can be reversed with a greater restoration spell, but only within 24 hours of it occurring'),(614,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,2,_binary '\0',13,NULL,6,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','One humanoid that the ghost can see within 5 feet of it must succeed on a DC 13 Charisma saving throw or be possessed by the ghost; the ghost then disappears, and the target is incapacitated and loses control of its body. The ghost now controls the body but doesn\'t deprive the target of awareness. The ghost can\'t be targeted by any attack, spell, or other effect, except ones that turn undead, and it retains its alignment, Intelligence, Wisdom, Charisma, and immunity to being charmed and frightened. It otherwise uses the possessed target\'s statistics, but doesn\'t gain access to the target\'s knowledge, class features, or proficiencies.\n\nThe possession lasts until the body drops to 0 hit points, the ghost ends it as a bonus action, or the ghost is turned or forced out by an effect like the dispel evil and good spell. When the possession ends, the ghost reappears in an unoccupied space within 5 feet of the body. The target is immune to this ghost\'s Possession for 24 hours after succeeding on the saving throw or after the possession ends.'),(617,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',3,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(618,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',5,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','If the target is a creature other than an undead, it must succeed on a DC 10 Constitution saving throw or be paralyzed for 1 minute. The target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.'),(619,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',2,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(620,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','If the target is a creature other than an elf or undead, it must succeed on a DC 10 Constitution saving throw or be paralyzed for 1 minute. The target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.'),(622,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The giant makes two morningstar attacks.'),(623,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',12,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(624,1,0,2,0,60,240,NULL,1,_binary '\0',12,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(625,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The giant makes two greatsword attacks.'),(626,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',11,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(627,1,0,2,0,60,240,NULL,1,_binary '\0',11,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(628,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The giant makes two greataxe attacks.'),(629,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',9,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(630,1,0,2,0,60,240,NULL,1,_binary '\0',9,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(631,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The giant makes two greatclub attacks.'),(632,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',8,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(633,1,0,2,0,60,240,NULL,1,_binary '\0',8,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(635,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The giant makes two greatclub attacks.'),(636,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',9,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(637,1,0,2,0,60,240,NULL,1,_binary '\0',9,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','If the target is a creature, it must succeed on a DC 17 Strength saving throw or be knocked prone.'),(638,3,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','If a rock or similar object is hurled at the giant, the giant can, with a successful DC 10 Dexterity saving throw, catch the missile and take no bludgeoning damage from it.'),(640,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NUL