oned for 1 minute. The target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.'),(659,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(660,1,0,2,0,80,320,62,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(666,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The golem makes two slam attacks.'),(667,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',8,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','If the target is a creature, it must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or have its hit point maximum reduced by an amount equal to the damage taken. The target dies if this attack reduces its hit point maximum to 0. The reduction lasts until removed by the greater restoration spell or other magic.'),(668,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','Until the end of its next turn, the golem magically gains a +2 bonus to its AC, has advantage on Dexterity saving throws, and can use its slam attack as a bonus action.'),(675,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The golem makes two slam attacks.'),(676,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(681,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The golem makes two melee attacks.'),(682,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',13,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(683,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',13,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(684,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,2,_binary '\0',19,NULL,3,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '','The golem exhales poisonous gas in a 15-foot cone. Each creature in that area must make a DC 19 Constitution saving throw, taking 45 (10d8) poison damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.'),(688,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The golem makes two melee attacks.'),(689,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',10,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(690,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,2,_binary '\0',17,NULL,5,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The golem targets one or more creatures it can see within 10 feet of it. Each target must make a DC 17 Wisdom saving throw against this magic. On a failed save, a target can\'t use reactions, its speed is halved, and it can\'t make more than one attack on its turn. In addition, the target can take either an action or a bonus action on its turn, not both. These effects last for 1 minute. A target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.'),(692,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',8,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(693,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',8,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(694,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,2,_binary '\0',13,NULL,3,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The gorgon exhales petrifying gas in a 30-foot cone. Each creature in that area must succeed on a DC 13 Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a target begins to turn to stone and is restrained. The restrained target must repeat the saving throw at the end of its next turn. On a success, the effect ends on the target. On a failure, the target is petrified until freed by the greater restoration spell or other magic.'),(696,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The grick makes one attack with its tentacles. If that attack hits, the grick can make one beak attack against the same target.'),(697,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(698,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(700,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The griffon makes two attacks: one with its beak and one with its claws.'),(701,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(702,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(706,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',5,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(709,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(710,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The hag covers herself and anything she is wearing or carrying with a magical illusion that makes her look like another creature of her general size and humanoid shape. The illusion ends if the hag takes a bonus action to end it or if she dies.\n\nThe changes wrought by this effect fail to hold up to physical inspection. For example, the hag could appear to have smooth skin, but someone touching her would feel her rough flesh. Otherwise, a creature must take an action to visually inspect the illusion and succeed on a DC 20 Intelligence (Investigation) check to discern that the hag is disguised.'),(711,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The hag magically turns invisible until she attacks or casts a spell, or until her concentration ends (as if concentrating on a spell). While invisible, she leaves no physical evidence of her passage, so she can be tracked only by magic. Any equipment she wears or carries is invisible with her.'),(713,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(714,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The hag magically polymorphs into a Small or Medium female humanoid, or back into her true form. Her statistics are the same in each form. Any equipment she is wearing or carrying isn\'t transformed. She reverts to her true form if she dies.'),(715,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The hag magically enters the Ethereal Plane from the Material Plane, or vice versa. To do so, the hag must have a heartstone in her possession.'),(716,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','While on the Ethereal Plane, the hag magically touches a sleeping humanoid on the Material Plane. A protection from evil and good spell cast on the target prevents this contact, as does a magic circle. As long as the contact persists, the target has dreadful visions. If these visions last for at least 1 hour, the target gains no benefit from its rest, and its hit point maximum is reduced by 5 (1d10). If this effect reduces the target\'s hit point maximum to 0, the target dies, and if the target was evil, its soul is trapped in the hag\'s soul bag. The reduction to the target\'s hit point maximum lasts until removed by the greater restoration spell or similar magic.'),(719,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',5,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(720,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,2,_binary '\0',11,NULL,5,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The hag targets one frightened creature she can see within 30 feet of her. If the target can see the hag, it must succeed on a DC 11 Wisdom saving throw against this magic or drop to 0 hit points.'),(721,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The hag covers herself and anything she is wearing or carrying with a magical illusion that makes her look like an ugly creature of her general size and humanoid shape. The effect ends if the hag takes a bonus action to end it or if she dies. The changes wrought by this effect fail to hold up to physical inspection. For example, the hag could appear to have no claws, but someone touching her hand might feel the claws. Otherwise, a creature must take an action to visually inspect the illusion and succeed on a DC 16 Intelligence (Investigation) check to discern that the hag is disguised.'),(722,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The veteran makes two longsword attacks. If it has a shortsword drawn, it can also make a shortsword attack.'),(723,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',5,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(724,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',5,NULL,NUL