inary '\0',10,NULL,2,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '','The mephit exhales a 15- foot cone of scalding steam. Each creature in that area must succeed on a DC 10 Dexterity saving throw, taking 4 (1d8) fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.'),(909,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',2,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(910,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',2,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(912,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The merrow makes two attacks: one with its bite and one with its claws or harpoon.'),(913,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(914,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(915,1,0,2,0,20,60,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','If the target is a Huge or smaller creature, it must succeed on a Strength contest against the merrow or be pulled up to 20 feet toward the merrow.'),(920,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',5,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','If the mimic is in object form, the target is subjected to its Adhesive trait.'),(921,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',5,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(925,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(926,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(927,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The mummy can use its Dreadful Glare and makes one attack with its rotting fist.'),(928,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',5,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','If the target is a creature, it must succeed on a DC 12 Constitution saving throw or be cursed with mummy rot. The cursed target can\'t regain hit points, and its hit point maximum decreases by 10 (3d6) for every 24 hours that elapse. If the curse reduces the target\'s hit point maximum to 0, the target dies, and its body turns to dust. The curse lasts until removed by the remove curse spell or other magic.'),(929,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,2,_binary '\0',11,NULL,5,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The mummy targets one creature it can see within 60 feet of it. If the target can see the mummy, it must succeed on a DC 11 Wisdom saving throw against this magic or become frightened until the end of the mummy\'s next turn. If the target fails the saving throw by 5 or more, it is also paralyzed for the same duration. A target that succeeds on the saving throw is immune to the Dreadful Glare of all mummies (but not mummy lords) for the next 24 hours.'),(932,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The mummy can use its Dreadful Glare and makes one attack with its rotting fist.'),(933,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',5,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','If the target is a creature, it must succeed on a DC 16 Constitution saving throw or be cursed with mummy rot. The cursed target can\'t regain hit points, and its hit point maximum decreases by 10 (3d6) for every 24 hours that elapse. If the curse reduces the target\'s hit point maximum to 0, the target dies, and its body turns to dust. The curse lasts until removed by the remove curse spell or other magic.'),(934,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,2,_binary '\0',11,NULL,5,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The mummy lord targets one creature it can see within 60 feet of it. If the target can see the mummy lord, it must succeed on a DC 16 Wisdom saving throw against this magic or become frightened until the end of the mummy\'s next turn. If the target fails the saving throw by 5 or more, it is also paralyzed for the same duration. A target that succeeds on the saving throw is immune to the Dreadful Glare of all mummies and mummy lords for the next 24 hours'),(935,6,1,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The mummy lord makes one attack with its rotting fist or uses its Dreadful Glare.'),(936,6,1,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','Blinding dust and sand swirls magically around the mummy lord. Each creature within 5 feet of the mummy lord must succeed on a DC 16 Constitution saving throw or be blinded until the end of the creature\'s next turn.'),(937,6,2,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The mummy lord utters a blasphemous word. Each non-undead creature within 10 feet of the mummy lord that can hear the magical utterance must succeed on a DC 16 Constitution saving throw or be stunned until the end of the mummy lord\'s next turn.'),(938,6,2,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The mummy lord magically unleashes negative energy. Creatures within 60 feet of the mummy lord, including ones behind barriers and around corners, can\'t regain hit points until the end of the mummy lord\'s next turn.'),(939,6,2,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The mummy lord magically transforms into a whirlwind of sand, moves up to 60 feet, and reverts to its normal form. While in whirlwind form, the mummy lord is immune to all damage, and it can\'t be grappled, petrified, knocked prone, restrained, or stunned. Equipment worn or carried by the mummy lord remain in its possession'),(941,1,0,1,10,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',8,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','Reach 10 ft., one creature: The target must make a DC 15 Constitution saving throw, taking 45 (10d8) poison damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.'),(942,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,2,_binary '\0',15,NULL,3,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '','+8 to hit, range 15/30 ft., one creature. Hit: The target must make a DC 15 Constitution saving throw, taking 45 (10d8) poison damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.'),(944,1,0,1,10,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','Reach 10 ft., one creature: The target must make a DC 13 Constitution saving throw, taking 31 (7d8) poison damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.'),(947,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(948,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The nightmare and up to three willing creatures within 5 feet of it magically enter the Ethereal Plane from the Material Plane, or vice versa.'),(949,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(950,1,0,2,0,30,120,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(953,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The oni makes two attacks, either with its claws or its glaive.'),(954,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(955,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(956,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(957,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The oni magically polymorphs into a Small or Medium humanoid, into a Large giant, or back into its true form. Other than its size, its statistics are the same in each form. The only equipment that is transformed is its glaive, which shrinks so that it can be wielded in humanoid form. If the oni dies, it reverts to its true form, and its glaive reverts to its normal size.'),(961,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',5,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','In addition, nonmagical armor worn by the target is partly dissolved and takes a permanent and cumulative −1 penalty to the AC it offers. The armor is destroyed if the penalty reduces its AC to 10.'),(962,3,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','When a pudding that is Medium or larger is subjected to lightning or slashing damage, it splits into two new puddings if it has at least 10 hit points. Each new pudding has hit points equal to half the original pudding\'s, rounded down. New puddings are one size smaller than the original pudding.'),(965,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(966,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The cube moves up to its speed. While doing so, it can enter Large or smaller creatures\' spaces. Whenever the cube enters a creature\'s space, the creature must make a DC 12 Dexterity saving throw.\n\nOn a successful save, the creature can choose to be pushed 5 feet back or to the side of the cube. A creature that chooses not to be pushed suffers the consequences of a failed saving throw.\n\nOn a failed save, the cube enters the creature\'s space, and the creature takes 10 (3d6) acid damage and is engulfed. The engulfed creature can\'t breathe, is restrained, and takes 21 (6d6) acid damage at the start of each of the cube\'s turns. When the cube moves, the engulfed creature moves with it.\n\nAn engulfed creature can try to escape by taking an action to make a DC 12 Strength check. On a success, the creature escapes and enters a space of its choice within 5 feet of the cube.'),(970,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',3,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','If the target is wearing nonmagical metal armor, its armor is partly corroded and takes a permanent and cumulative −1 penalty to the AC it offers. The armor is destroyed if the penalty reduces its AC to 10.'),(973,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(974,3,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','When a jelly that is Medium or larger is subjected to lightning or slashing damage, it splits into two new jellies if it has at least 10 hit points. Each new jelly has hit points equal to half the original jelly\'s, rounded down. New jellies are one size smaller than the original jelly.'),(976,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',5,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(977,1,0,2,0,30,120,NULL,1,_binary '\0',5,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(979,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The otyugh makes three attacks: one with its bite and two with its tentacles.'),(980,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','If the target is a creature, it must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw against disease or become poisoned until the disease is cured. Every 24 hours that elapse, the target must repeat the saving throw, reducing its hit point maximum by 5 (1d10) on a failure. The disease is cured on a success. The target dies if the disease reduces its hit point maximum to 0. This reduction to the target\'s hit point maximum lasts until the disease is cured.'),(981,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','If the target is Medium or smaller, it is grappled (escape DC 13) and restrained until the grapple ends. The otyugh has two tentacles, each of which can grapple one target'),(982,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,2,_binary '\0',14,NULL,3,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '','The otyugh slams creatures grappled by it into each other or a solid surface. Each creature must succeed on a DC 14 Constitution saving throw or take 10 (2d6 + 3) bludgeoning damage and be stunned until the end of the otyugh\'s next turn. On a successful save, the target takes half the bludgeoning damage and isn\'t stunned.'),(984,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The owlbear makes two attacks: one with its beak and one with its claws.'),(985,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(986,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(987,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(991,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(992,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The target must succeed on a DC 11 Constitution saving throw or become poisoned for 1 hour. If the saving throw fails by 5 or more, the target falls unconscious for the same duration, or until it takes damage or another creature uses an action to shake it awake.'),(994,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The worm makes two attacks: one with its bite and one with its stinger.'),(995,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',9,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it must succeed on a DC 19 Dexterity saving throw or be swallowed by the worm. A swallowed creature is blinded and restrained, it has total cover against attacks and other effects outside the worm, and it takes 21 (6d6) acid damage at the start of each of the worm\'s turns.\n\nIf the worm takes 30 damage or more on a single turn from a creature inside it, the worm must succeed on a DC 21 Constitution saving throw at the end of that turn or regurgitate all swallowed creatures, which fall prone in a space within 10 feet of the worm. If the worm dies, a swallowed creature is no longer restrained by it and can escape from the corpse by using 20 feet of movement, exiting prone.'),(996,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',9,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The target must make a DC 19 Constitution saving throw, taking 42 (12d6) poison damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.'),(998,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The rakshasa makes two claw attacks.'),(999,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The target is cursed if it is a creature. The magical curse takes effect whenever the target takes a short or long rest, filling the target\'s thoughts with horrible images and dreams. The cursed target gains no benefit from finishing a short or long rest. The curse lasts until it is lifted by a remove curse spell or similar magic.'),(1001,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',11,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','If the target is a creature, it is grappled (escape DC 17). Until this grapple ends, the target is restrained, and the remorhaz can\'t bite another target.'),(1002,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The remorhaz makes one bite attack against a Medium or smaller creature it is grappling. If the attack hits, that creature takes the bite\'s damage and is swallowed, and the grapple ends. While swallowed, the creature is blinded and restrained, it has total cover against attacks and other effects outside the remorhaz, and it takes 21 (6d6) acid damage at the start of each of the remorhaz\'s turns. If the remorhaz takes 30 damage or more on a single turn from a creature inside it, the remorhaz must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw at the end of that turn or regurgitate all swallowed creatures, which fall prone in a space within 10 feet of the remorhaz. If the remorhaz dies, a swallowed creature is no longer restrained by it and can escape from the corpse using 15 feet of movement, exiting prone.'),(1004,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The roc makes two attacks: one with its beak and one with its talons.'),(1005,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',13,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1006,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',13,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The target is grappled (escape DC 19). Until this grapple ends, the target is restrained, and the roc can\'t use its talons on another target.'),(1010,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The roper makes four attacks with its tendrils, uses Reel, and makes one attack with its bite.'),(1011,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1012,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','+7 to hit, reach 50 ft., one creature. Hit: The target is grappled (escape DC 15). Until the grapple ends, the target is restrained and has disadvantage on Strength checks and Strength saving throws, and the roper can\'t use the same tendril on another target.'),(1013,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The roper pulls each creature grappled by it up to 25 feet straight toward it.'),(1016,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',3,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1017,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The rust monster corrodes a nonmagical ferrous metal object it can see within 5 feet of it. If the object isn\'t being worn or carried, the touch destroys a 1-foot cube of it. If the object is being worn or carried by a creature, the creature can make a DC 11 Dexterity saving throw to avoid the rust monster\'s touch.\n\nIf the object touched is either metal armor or a metal shield being worn or carried, its takes a permanent and cumulative −1 penalty to the AC it offers. Armor reduced to an AC of 10 or a shield that drops to a +0 bonus is destroyed. If the object touched is a held metal weapon, it rusts as described in the Rust Metal trait.'),(1021,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The sahuagin makes two melee attacks: one with its bite and one with its claws or spear.'),(1022,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',3,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1023,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',3,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1024,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',3,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1025,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',3,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1028,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The salamander makes two attacks: one with its spear and one with its tail.'),(1029,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1030,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1031,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The target is grappled (escape DC 14). Until this grapple ends, the target is restrained, the salamander can automatically hit the target with its tail, and the salamander can\'t make tail attacks against other targets.'),(1033,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',3,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1034,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',5,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1035,1,0,2,0,80,320,62,1,_binary '\0',5,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1039,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The target\'s Strength score is reduced by 1d4. The target dies if this reduces its Strength to 0. Otherwise, the reduction lasts until the target finishes a short or long rest. If a non-evil humanoid dies from this attack, a new shadow rises from the corpse 1d4 hours later.'),(1041,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The shambling mound makes two slam attacks. If both attacks hit a Medium or smaller target, the target is grappled (escape DC 14), and the shambling mound uses its Engulf on it.'),(1042,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1043,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The shambling mound engulfs a Medium or smaller creature grappled by it. The engulfed target is blinded, restrained, and unable to breathe, and it must succeed on a DC 14 Constitution saving throw at the start of each of the mound\'s turns or take 13 (2d8 + 4) bludgeoning damage. If the mound moves, the engulfed target moves with it. The mound can have only one creature engulfed at a time.'),(1047,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The guardian makes two fist attacks.'),(1048,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1049,3,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','When a creature makes an attack against the wearer of the guardian\'s amulet, the guardian grants a +2 bonus to the wearer\'s AC if the guardian is within 5 feet of the wearer.'),(1050,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1051,1,0,2,0,80,320,62,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1053,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1054,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1055,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1058,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The target must succeed on a DC 10 Constitution saving throw or its hit point maximum is reduced by an amount equal to the damage taken. This reduction lasts until the creature finishes a long rest. The target dies if this effect reduces its hit point maximum to 0.'),(1061,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The sphinx makes two claw attacks.'),(1062,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',12,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1063,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The sphinx emits a magical roar. Each time it roars before finishing a long rest, the roar is louder and the effect is different, as detailed below. Each creature within 500 feet of the sphinx and able to hear the roar must make a saving throw.\n\nFirst Roar: Each creature that fails a DC 18 Wisdom saving throw is frightened for 1 minute. A frightened creature can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.\n\nSecond Roar: Each creature that fails a DC 18 Wisdom saving throw is deafened and frightened for 1 minute. A frightened creature is paralyzed and can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.\n\nThird Roar: Each creature makes a DC 18 Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 44 (8d10) thunder damage and is knocked prone. On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage and isn\'t knocked prone.'),(1064,6,1,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The sphinx makes one claw attack.'),(1065,6,2,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The sphinx magically teleports, along with any equipment it is wearing or carrying, up to 120 feet to an unoccupied space it can see.'),(1066,6,3,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The sphinx casts a spell from its list of prepared spells, using a spell slot as normal.'),(1069,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The sphinx makes two claw attacks.'),(1070,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',8,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1071,6,1,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The sphinx makes one claw attack.'),(1072,6,2,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The sphinx magically teleports, along with any equipment it is wearing or carrying, up to 120 feet to an unoccupied space it can see.'),(1073,6,3,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The sphinx casts a spell from its list of prepared spells, using a spell slot as normal.'),(1074,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',2,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1075,1,0,2,0,40,160,62,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The target must succeed on a DC 10 Constitution saving throw or become poisoned for 1 minute. If its saving throw result is 5 or lower, the poisoned target falls unconscious for the same duration, or until it takes damage or another creature takes an action to shake it awake.'),(1076,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The sprite touches a creature and magically knows the creature\'s current emotional state. If the target fails a DC 10 Charisma saving throw, the sprite also knows the creature\'s alignment. Celestials, fiends, and undead automatically fail the saving throw.'),(1077,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The sprite magically turns invisible until it attacks or casts a spell, or until its concentration ends (as if concentrating on a spell). Any equipment the sprite wears or carries is invisible with it.'),(1078,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',5,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The stirge attaches to the target. While attached, the stirge doesn\'t attack. Instead, at the start of each of the stirge\'s turns, the target loses 5 (1d4 + 3) hit points due to blood loss. The stirge can detach itself by spending 5 feet of its movement. It does so after it drains 10 hit points of blood from the target or the target dies. A creature, including the target, can use its action to detach the stirge.'),(1081,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',5,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1082,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','One humanoid the fiend can see within 30 feet of it must succeed on a DC 15 Wisdom saving throw or be magically charmed for 1 day. The charmed target obeys the fiend\'s verbal or telepathic commands. If the target suffers any harm or receives a suicidal command, it can repeat the saving throw, ending the effect on a success. If the target successfully saves against the effect, or if the effect on it ends, the target is immune to this fiend\'s Charm for the next 24 hours.\n\nThe fiend can have only one target charmed at a time. If it charms another, the effect on the previous target ends.'),(1083,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,2,_binary '\0',15,NULL,3,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '','The fiend kisses a creature charmed by it or a willing creature. The target must make a DC 15 Constitution saving throw against this magic, taking 32 (5d10 + 5) psychic damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. The target\'s hit point maximum is reduced by an amount equal to the damage taken. This reduction lasts until the target finishes a long rest. The target dies if this effect reduces its hit point maximum to 0.'),(1084,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The fiend magically enters the Ethereal Plane from the Material Plane, or vice versa.'),(1089,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The tarrasque can use its Frightful Presence. It then makes five attacks: one with its bite, two with its claws, one with its horns, and one with its tail. It can use its Swallow instead of its bite.'),(1090,1,0,1,10,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',19,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','Reach 10 ft, one target: If the target is a creature, it is grappled (escape DC 20). Until this grapple ends, the target is restrained, and the tarrasque can\'t bite another target.'),(1091,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',19,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1092,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',19,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1093,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',19,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','If the target is a creature, it must succeed on a DC 20 Strength saving throw or be knocked prone.'),(1094,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','Each creature of the tarrasque\'s choice within 120 feet of it and aware of it must succeed on a DC 17 Wisdom saving throw or become frightened for 1 minute. A creature can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, with disadvantage if the tarrasque is within line of sight, ending the effect on itself on a success. If a creature\'s saving throw is successful or the effect ends for it, the creature is immune to the tarrasque\'s Frightful Presence for the next 24 hours.'),(1095,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The tarrasque makes one bite attack against a Large or smaller creature it is grappling. If the attack hits, the target takes the bite\'s damage, the target is swallowed, and the grapple ends. While swallowed, the creature is blinded and restrained, it has total cover against attacks and other effects outside the tarrasque, and it takes 56 (16d6) acid damage at the start of each of the tarrasque\'s turns.\n\nIf the tarrasque takes 60 damage or more on a single turn from a creature inside it, the tarrasque must succeed on a DC 20 Constitution saving throw at the end of that turn or regurgitate all swallowed creatures, which fall prone in a space within 10 feet of the tarrasque. If the tarrasque dies, a swallowed creature is no longer restrained by it and can escape from the corpse by using 30 feet of movement, exiting prone.'),(1096,6,1,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The tarrasque makes one claw attack or tail attack.'),(1097,6,1,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The tarrasque moves up to half its speed.'),(1098,6,2,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The tarrasque makes one bite attack or uses its Swallow.'),(1101,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The treant makes two slam attacks.'),(1102,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',10,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1103,1,0,2,0,60,180,NULL,1,_binary '\0',10,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1104,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The treant magically animates one or two trees it can see within 60 feet of it. These trees have the same statistics as a treant, except they have Intelligence and Charisma scores of 1, they can\'t speak, and they have only the Slam action option. An animated tree acts as an ally of the treant. The tree remains animate for 1 day or until it dies; until the treant dies or is more than 120 feet from the tree; or until the treant takes a bonus action to turn it back into an inanimate tree. The tree then takes root if possible.'),(1107,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The troll makes three attacks: one with its bite and two with its claws.'),(1108,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1109,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1113,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The unicorn makes two attacks: one with its hooves and one with its horn.'),(1118,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1115,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',7,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0',''),(1116,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The unicorn touches another creature with its horn. The target magically regains 11 (2d8 + 2) hit points. In addition, the touch removes all diseases and neutralizes all poisons afflicting the target.'),(1117,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The unicorn magically teleports itself and up to three willing creatures it can see within 5 feet of it, along with any equipment they are wearing or carrying, to a location the unicorn is familiar with, up to 1 mile away.'),(1118,6,1,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The unicorn makes one attack with its hooves.'),(1119,6,2,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The unicorn creates a shimmering, magical field around itself or another creature it can see within 60 feet of it. The target gains a +2 bonus to AC until the end of the unicorn\'s next turn.'),(1120,6,3,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The unicorn magically regains 11 (2d8 + 2) hit points.'),(1127,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The vampire makes two attacks, only one of which can be a bite attack.'),(1128,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',9,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','Instead of dealing damage, the vampire can grapple the target (escape DC 18).'),(1129,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',9,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','One willing creature, or a creature that is grappled by the vampire, incapacitated or restrained: The target\'s hit point maximum is reduced by an amount equal to the necrotic damage taken, and the vampire regains hit points equal to that amount. The reduction lasts until the target finishes a long rest. The target dies if this effect reduces its hit point maximum to 0. A humanoid slain in this way and then buried in the ground rises the following night as a vampire spawn under the vampire\'s control.'),(1130,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The vampire targets one humanoid it can see within 30 feet of it. If the target can see the vampire, the target must succeed on a DC 17 Wisdom saving throw against this magic or be charmed by the vampire. The charmed target regards the vampire as a trusted friend to be heeded and protected. Although the target isn\'t under the vampire\'s control, it takes the vampire\'s requests or actions in the most favorable way it can, and it is a willing target for the vampire\'s bite attack. Each time the vampire or the vampire\'s companions do anything harmful to the target, it can repeat the saving throw, ending the effect on itself on a success. Otherwise, the effect lasts 24 hours or until the vampire is destroyed, is on a different plane of existence than the target, or takes a bonus action to end the effect.'),(1131,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The vampire magically calls 2d4 swarms of bats or rats, provided that the sun isn\'t up. While outdoors, the vampire can call 3d6 wolves instead. The called creatures arrive in 1d4 rounds, acting as allies of the vampire and obeying its spoken commands. The beasts remain for 1 hour, until the vampire dies, or until the vampire dismisses them as a bonus action.'),(1132,6,1,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The vampire moves up to its speed without provoking opportunity attacks'),(1133,6,1,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The vampire makes one unarmed strike.'),(1134,6,2,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The vampire makes one bite attack.'),(1138,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The vampire makes two attacks, only one of which can be a bite attack.'),(1139,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','Instead of dealing damage, the vampire can grapple the target (escape DC 13).'),(1140,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',6,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','One willing creature, or a creature that is grappled by the vampire, incapacitated or restrained: The target\'s hit point maximum is reduced by an amount equal to the necrotic damage taken, and the vampire regains hit points equal to that amount. The reduction lasts until the target finishes a long rest. The target dies if this effect reduces its hit point maximum to 0.'),(1142,1,0,1,0,0,0,NULL,4,_binary '\0',0,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The wight makes two longsword attacks or two longbow attacks. It can use its Life Drain in place of one longsword attack.'),(1143,1,0,1,5,0,0,NULL,1,_binary '\0',4,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,_binary '\0','The target must succeed on a DC 13 Constitution saving throw or its hit point maximum is reduced by an amount equal to the damage taken. This reduction lasts until the target finishes a long rest. The target dies if this effec