ing large enough for a Tiny insect. The swarm can\'t regain hit points or gain temporary hit points.'),(1412,'The swarm can occupy another creature\'s space and vice versa, and the swarm can move through any opening large enough for a Tiny snake. The swarm can\'t regain hit points or gain temporary hit points.'),(1414,'The swarm has advantage on melee attack rolls against any creature that doesn\'t have all its hit points.'),(1415,'The swarm can occupy another creature\'s space and vice versa, and the swarm can move through any opening large enough for a Tiny quipper. The swarm can\'t regain hit points or gain temporary hit points.'),(1416,'The swarm can breathe only underwater.'),(1418,'The swarm has advantage on Wisdom (Perception) checks that rely on smell.'),(1419,'The swarm can occupy another creature\'s space and vice versa, and the swarm can move through any opening large enough for a Tiny rat. The swarm can\'t regain hit points or gain temporary hit points.'),(1421,'The swarm can occupy another creature\'s space and vice versa, and the swarm can move through any opening large enough for a Tiny raven. The swarm can\'t regain hit points or gain temporary hit points.'),(1423,'The tiger has advantage on Wisdom (Perception) checks that rely on smell.'),(1424,'If the tiger moves at least 20 feet straight toward a creature and then hits it with a claw attack on the same turn, that target must succeed on a DC 13 Strength saving throw or be knocked prone. If the target is prone, the tiger can make one bite attack against it as a bonus action.'),(1427,'The vulture has advantage on Wisdom (Perception) checks that rely on sight or smell.'),(1428,'The vulture has advantage on an attack roll against a creature if at least one of the vulture\'s allies is within 5 feet of the creature and the ally isn\'t incapacitated.'),(1430,'If the horse moves at least 20 feet straight toward a creature and then hits it with a hooves attack on the same turn, that target must succeed on a