,'The cultist has advantage on saving throws against being charmed or frightened.'),(1464,'The fanatic has advantage on saving throws against being charmed or frightened.'),(1469,'The gladiator has advantage on saving throws against being frightened.'),(1470,'A melee weapon deals one extra die of its damage when the gladiator hits with it (included in the attack).'),(1478,'The gladiator has advantage on saving throws against being frightened.'),(1479,'A melee weapon deals one extra die of its damage when the gladiator hits with it (included in the attack).'),(1488,'As a bonus action, the priest can expend a spell slot to cause its melee weapon attacks to magically deal an extra 10 (3d6) radiant damage to a target on a hit. This benefit lasts until the end of the turn. If the priest expends a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the extra damage increases by 1d6 for each level above 1st.'),(1490,'The scout has advantage on Wisdom (Perception) checks that rely on hearing or sight.'),(1494,'On each of its turns, the spy can use a bonus action to take the Dash, Disengage, or Hide action.'),(1495,'Once per turn, the spy deals an extra 7 (2d6) damage when it hits a target with a weapon attack and has advantage on the attack roll, or when the target is within 5 feet of an ally of the spy that isn\'t incapacitated and the spy doesn\'t have disadvantage on the attack roll.'),(1499,'The thug has advantage on an attack roll against a creature if at least one of the thug\'s allies is within 5 feet of the creature and the ally isn\'t incapacitated.'),(1503,'The warrior has advantage on an attack roll against a creature if at least one of the warrior\'s allies is within 5 feet of the creature and the ally isn\'t incapacitated.');
