	(@NalfeshneeMultiattackId, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, null, 4, 0, 0, null, null, 0, null, 0, 'The nalfeshnee uses Horror Nimbus if it can. It then makes three attacks: one with its bite and two with its claws.'),
