	(@VrockSporesId, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, null, 4, 0, 0, null, null, 0, null, 0, 'A 15-foot-radius cloud of toxic spores extends out from the vrock. The spores spread around corners. Each creature in that area must succeed on a DC 14 Constitution saving throw or become poisoned. While poisoned in this way, a target takes 5 (1d10) poison damage at the start of each of its turns. A target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. Emptying a vial of holy water on the target also ends the effect on it.'),
	(@VrockStunningScreechId, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, null, 4, 0, 0, null, null, 0, null, 0, 'The vrock emits a horrific screech. Each creature within 20 feet of it that can hear it and that isn''t a demon must succeed on a DC 14 Constitution saving throw or be stunned until the end of the vrock''s next turn.'),
	(@BarbedDevilMultiattackId, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, null, 4, 0, 0, null, null, 0, null, 0, 'The devil makes three melee attacks: one with its tail and two with its claws. Alternatively, it can use Hurl Flame twice.'),
