	(@ErinyesParryId, 3, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, null, 4, 0, 0, null, null, 0, null, 0, 'The erinyes adds 4 to its AC against one melee attack that would hit it. To do so, the erinyes must see the attacker and be wielding a melee weapon.'),
	(@HornedDevilMultiattackId, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, null, 4, 0, 0, null, null, 0, null, 0, 'The devil makes three melee attacks: two with its fork and one with its tail. It can use Hurl Flame in place of any melee attack.'),
