	(@DragonTurtleMultiattackId, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, null, 4, 0, 0, null, null, 0, null, 0, 'The dragon turtle makes three attacks: one with its bite and two with its claws. It can make one tail attack in place of its two claw attacks.'),
